{"step_index":1111,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:37:57Z","thinking":"**Connecting walk and ballWithin**\n\n`mem_ballWithin_of_walk` has been rigorously verified; it's a critical link between Mathlib's graph theory and `GraphCalc.ballWithin`. A walk `p` from `u` to `v` necessarily means `v` is within the ball of radius `p.length` centered at `u`.  This establishes that if a walk of length $L$ exists between $u$ and $v$, then $v$ is in $\\text{ballWithin } G\\ L\\ u$.  The monotonicity of `ballWithin` can then be exploited.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"cat << 'EOF' >> scratch.lean\\n\\nlemma ballWithin_subset_succ {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V] (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (k : ℕ) (v : V) :\\n    GraphCalc.ballWithin G k v ⊆ GraphCalc.ballWithin G (k + 1) v := by\\n  dsimp [GraphCalc.ballWithin]\\n  exact Finset.subset_union_left\\n\\nlemma ballWithin_mono {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V] (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj]\\n    (v : V) {k m : ℕ} (h : k ≤ m) : GraphCalc.ballWithin G k v ⊆ GraphCalc.ballWithin G m v := by\\n  obtain ⟨d, rfl⟩ := Nat.exists_eq_add_of_le h\\n  clear h\\n  induction d with\\n  | zero => exact Finset.Subset.refl _\\n  | succ d' ih =>\\n    exact Finset.Subset.trans ih (ballWithin_subset_succ G (k + d') v)\\n\\nlemma mem_ballWithin_of_walk_le {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V] (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj]\\n    {u v : V} (p : G.Walk u v) {k : ℕ} (h : p.length ≤ k) :\\n    v ∈ GraphCalc.ballWithin G k u :=\\n  ballWithin_mono G u h (mem_ballWithin_of_walk G p)\\nEOF\\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh scratch.lean\"","Cwd":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_2a2555cc\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"10000","toolAction":"\"Testing ballWithin_mono and mem_ballWithin_of_walk_le\"","toolSummary":"\"Test ballWithin_mono\""}}]}
{"step_index":1112,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:38:01Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T01:38:01+02:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: 77001943-b7df-4df1-ba5c-db7288bf8e72/task-1112\nTask Description: cat << 'EOF' >> scratch.lean\n\nlemma ballWithin_subset_succ {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V] (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (k : ℕ) (v : V) :\n    GraphCalc.ballWithin G k v ⊆ GraphCalc.ballWithin G (k + 1) v := by\n  dsimp [GraphCalc.ballWithin]\n  exact Finset.subset_union_left\n\nlemma ballWithin_mono {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V] (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj]\n    (v : V) {k m : ℕ} (h : k ≤ m) : GraphCalc.ballWithin G k v ⊆ GraphCalc.ballWithin G m v := by\n  obtain ⟨d, rfl⟩ := Nat.exists_eq_add_of_le h\n  clear h\n  induction d with\n  | zero => exact Finset.Subset.refl _\n  | succ d' ih =>\n    exact Finset.Subset.trans ih (ballWithin_subset_succ G (k + d') v)\n\nlemma mem_ballWithin_of_walk_le {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V] (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj]\n    {u v : V} (p : G.Walk u v) {k : ℕ} (h : p.length ≤ k) :\n    v ∈ GraphCalc.ballWithin G k u :=\n  ballWithin_mono G u h (mem_ballWithin_of_walk G p)\nEOF\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh scratch.lean\nTask logs are available at: file:///tmp/agyhome.wwbf9z/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/77001943-b7df-4df1-ba5c-db7288bf8e72/.system_generated/tasks/task-1112.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
